  "network": "Owned one-TAP namespace,192.0.2.2 provider17 and192.0.2.3 provider18; no physical interface",
  "observations": [
    "v25 activation0x16/0x47 replies are exercised but still one public row appears with pre-activation identity cycling",
    "v26 holds the periodic identity field fixed from startup; reviewed Source screenshot shows Hub USB1 Research/computer1 and Hub USB2 Research/computer2 simultaneously",
    "v27 independently selects both Source rows: provider1 Browse shows1 real track, provider2 Browse shows2546 tracks",
    "Both providers receive their own native setup/menu/render requests and maintain separate per-connection state",
    "The two metadata inputs are differently filtered snapshots of the same hub0 PDB, not two independently mounted live sticks"
  ],
